jobs.content:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;About Turing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_-1033525666082252048m_-8288224233410703305gmail-docs-internal-guid-39386146-7fff-394b-7c89-9e58d80485b6&quot;&gt;Turing’s mission is to accelerate superintelligence to drive real economic progress. Headquartered in San Francisco, Turing works with frontier AI labs to generate high-quality datasets, reinforcement learning environments, and frontier research benchmarks that improve model capabilities in software engineering, enterprise knowledge work, and advanced STEM reasoning. In software engineering, Turing is the largest and longest-running data provider in the category. Turing also works with Fortune 500 enterprises across financial services, life sciences, healthcare, retail, automotive, and CPG to build and deploy end-to-end agentic AI systems inside mission-critical workflows. By operating on both sides, Turing closes the loop between frontier research and enterprise deployment, turning real-world deployment signals into better data, evaluations, and more capable models. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.turing.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.turing.com&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1788032823652000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2LLfe9HeuAcQz5ewoGP-0C&quot;&gt;www.turing.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Turing is looking for people with GenAI experience to join us in solving business problems for our Fortune 500 customers. You will be a key member of the Turing GenAI delivery organization leading a GenAI project end-to-end from POC to full-scale implementation and you will be leading a team of other Turing engineers across different skill sets. In the past, the Turing GenAI delivery organization has implemented industry-leading multi-agent LLM systems, RAG systems, and Open Source LLM deployments for major enterprises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client Relationship and Communication:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead discussions with clients&lt;/strong&gt; and prospects to build AI product pipeline and expand to more processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize client engagement, strengthen relationships, and manage expectations proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a point of contact for client communication, feedback and escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evaluate and select use-cases &lt;/strong&gt;for new product development and unlock new revenue opportunities for the client&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in client’s internal stakeholder meetings (when applicable) to capture, clarify, and consolidate requirements across functions, ensuring all inputs are properly documented and mapped into actionable product needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech Leadership:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical direction to the engineering team on appropriate solutioning &amp;amp; system design for a given problem statement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align the engineering team toward a technical roadmap and ensure timely execution of the roadmap to achieve customer satisfaction.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Study new LLM research topics and engage in conversation on same with client stakeholders to showcase technical prowess and build value for Turing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Leadership and Coordination:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive cross-functional alignment &lt;/strong&gt;across engineering, product, and client success teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remove blockers &lt;/strong&gt;for both the client &amp;amp; internal teams by ensuring smooth communication and effective prioritization flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular &lt;strong&gt;1:1 meetings&lt;/strong&gt; focused on support, expectations, delivery alignment, and general well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project Planning and Oversight:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the &lt;strong&gt;big-picture program timeline&lt;/strong&gt; (releases, phases, go-live plans) using engineering velocity and capacity inputs provided by the Engagement Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-own delivery planning by managing the program-level timeline and facilitating Sprint Planning sessions ensuring release milestones and sprint goals are aligned with business priorities, clearly defined requirements, and the engineering capacity and feasibility inputs provided by the Engagement Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own overall delivery&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure quality, scope, and timelines are consistently met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure robust &lt;strong&gt;business-facing documentation&lt;/strong&gt;, including requirements documents, BRDs/PRDs, implementation plans, product roadmaps, and client-facing marketing or enablement materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure delivery decisions reflect&amp;nbsp; an understanding of operational &lt;strong&gt;costs, ROI, and long-term business impact&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify delivery risks&lt;/strong&gt;, create proactive mitigation plans, and track program health across all milestones with keen insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Acknowledge new client requests promptly and partner with the Engagement Manager to assess &lt;/strong&gt;feasibility, capacity, and timeline impact before providing any commitment to the client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills &amp;amp; stakeholder management to effectively collaborate with client SMEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial &amp;amp; founders mindset to own end-to-end GenAI project deliveries and guide customers through various phases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of professional experience with at least 4+ years in driving Machine Learning &amp;amp; AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of the latest GenAI agentic designs and frameworks like Langchain, Langgraph, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Cloud services including Azure, GCP, or AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Agile methodologies and project management tools like JIRA, Confluence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation Range&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;$240k - $260K&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;qzdk59&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3&quot; data-end=&quot;13&quot;&gt;Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;15&quot; data-end=&quot;419&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9oqdlb&quot; data-start=&quot;15&quot; data-end=&quot;155&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;17&quot; data-end=&quot;41&quot;&gt;We are client first:&lt;/strong&gt; We put our clients at the center of everything we do, because their success is the ultimate measure of our value.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4xrcao&quot; data-start=&quot;156&quot; data-end=&quot;279&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;158&quot; data-end=&quot;188&quot;&gt;We work at Start-Up Speed:&lt;/strong&gt; We move fast, stay agile and favor action because momentum is the foundation of perfection&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2wslti&quot; data-start=&quot;280&quot; data-end=&quot;419&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;282&quot; data-end=&quot;304&quot;&gt;We are AI forward:&lt;/strong&gt; We help our clients build the future of Al and implement it in our own roles and workflow to amplify productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1jfjbs5&quot; data-start=&quot;421&quot; data-end=&quot;456&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;424&quot; data-end=&quot;456&quot;&gt;Advantages of joining Turing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;458&quot; data-end=&quot;1146&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gyrku4&quot; data-start=&quot;458&quot; data-end=&quot;640&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;460&quot; data-end=&quot;490&quot;&gt;Work at the frontier of AI&lt;/strong&gt;, helping the world’s leading AI labs improve their most advanced models by building expert datasets, RL environments, and first-of-a-kind benchmarks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;148ypmf&quot; data-start=&quot;641&quot; data-end=&quot;760&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;643&quot; data-end=&quot;685&quot;&gt;Contribute to leading-edge AI research&lt;/strong&gt; and showcase your work at top conferences such as ICLR, ICML, and NeurIPS.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;64klso&quot; data-start=&quot;761&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;763&quot; data-end=&quot;813&quot;&gt;Bring frontier AI innovation to the enterprise&lt;/strong&gt;, applying lessons learned from leading AI labs to solve real-world business challenges.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ag0cn9&quot; data-start=&quot;902&quot; data-end=&quot;1053&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;904&quot; data-end=&quot;962&quot;&gt;Collaborate with and learn from exceptional colleagues&lt;/strong&gt; with deep AI experience from Google, Meta, Amazon, and other leading technology companies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1eyqipj&quot; data-start=&quot;1054&quot; data-end=&quot;1146&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1056&quot; data-end=&quot;1093&quot;&gt;Move at the pace of AI innovation&lt;/strong&gt;, with the speed, ownership, and impact of a startup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Turing is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, age, marital status, disability, protected veteran status, or any other legally protected characteristics. At Turing we are dedicated to building a diverse, inclusive and authentic workplace&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;and celebrate authenticity, so if you’re excited about this role but your past experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;For applicants from the European Union, please review&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.turing.com/policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Turing&#39;s GDPR notice here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;About Turing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_-1033525666082252048m_-8288224233410703305gmail-docs-internal-guid-39386146-7fff-394b-7c89-9e58d80485b6&quot;&gt;Turing’s mission is to accelerate superintelligence to drive real economic progress. Headquartered in San Francisco, Turing works with frontier AI labs to generate high-quality datasets, reinforcement learning environments, and frontier research benchmarks that improve model capabilities in software engineering, enterprise knowledge work, and advanced STEM reasoning. In software engineering, Turing is the largest and longest-running data provider in the category. Turing also works with Fortune 500 enterprises across financial services, life sciences, healthcare, retail, automotive, and CPG to build and deploy end-to-end agentic AI systems inside mission-critical workflows. By operating on both sides, Turing closes the loop between frontier research and enterprise deployment, turning real-world deployment signals into better data, evaluations, and more capable models. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.turing.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.turing.com&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1788032823652000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2LLfe9HeuAcQz5ewoGP-0C&quot;&gt;www.turing.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;About the Team&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Office of the CEO operates at the center of Turing&#39;s highest-priority strategic initiatives. We partner across executive leadership while representing the company externally with investors, frontier AI labs, enterprise customers, board members, strategic partners, and industry leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This team exists to create leverage for the CEO where the company&#39;s most important external decisions are made.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional Chief of Staff role. Rather than running internal operations, you will become the CEO&#39;s external force multiplier. You’ll be in the room, at the table, on the plane, and in the follow-up thread for the most important external conversations the company has—with investors, frontier AI labs, Fortune 500 executives, strategic partners, journalists, and board members—and ensure those high-stakes conversations translate into impactful outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Often, successful candidates view this opportunity as an intense tour of duty. You will see and influence more consequential decisions in this role than most people experience in a decade.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For the right person, this tour can become a pathway to executive leadership at Turing—or a launchpad toward becoming a founder yourself.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the next 12 months, Turing will navigate one of the most consequential periods in its growth. Success in this role will directly influence how effectively the CEO scales relationships with investors, frontier AI labs, strategic partners, and enterprise leaders while advancing the company&#39;s long-term growth strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be a trusted strategic partner to the CEO on the company&#39;s highest-priority external initiatives. You will help execute Turing&#39;s next capital formation milestone, build repeatable systems for managing the CEO&#39;s most important external relationships, elevate the quality of executive materials and strategic communications, and independently drive company-defining initiatives on behalf of the CEO.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Turing&#39;s Capital Agenda.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the defining project of the next 12 months. You run the CEO-side process with the CEO and our advisors: investor target lists, sequencing, materials, data room coordination, diligence management, and relentless follow-through. You have seen a process like this from the investor side. Now you will help run one from the inside.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turing’s External Narrative.&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver the decks and memos for the meetings that matter most: investors, lab leadership, board, press, and strategic partners. You write at the level of the best investment memos you have read, and you build decks a CEO can walk into a room with—unedited.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Strategic Partnerships.&lt;/strong&gt; Prepare, sequence, and drive follow-through on our largest commercial relationships with frontier labs—relationships that can reach nine and ten figures. Own pre-reads, stakeholder maps, term summaries, relationship context, and next steps that actually happen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Executive Relationship Intelligence.&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate the systems that ensure the CEO&#39;s highest-value relationships remain informed, intentional, and active. These relationships span researchers, human data and operations leaders, executives across frontier AI labs and enterprise customers, and the investor community. You build and run the system that keeps every one of them warm: briefing docs before every meeting, intelligence on what each person cares about, and follow-ups that land within 24 hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute High-Impact Special Projects.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead confidential strategic initiatives requiring judgment, discretion, and exceptional execution. Bring recommendations, not questions, and consistently deliver complete staff work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Not Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role intentionally focuses on external strategy and execution. You will not:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own internal company operating cadence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage executive calendars, travel, or administrative support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead finance strategy or financial modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own GTM account execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage internal program management functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An investor and a dealmaker.&lt;/strong&gt; You have 2-4 years in investment banking, growth equity, venture, or corporate development, and you have carried a live process to close. A background that combines finance or top-tier consulting with venture is ideal. What we are screening for is someone who has run something with a deadline, a counterparty, and consequences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A network multiplier.&lt;/strong&gt; You build meaningful relationships across the venture and growth ecosystem—with partners, principals, founders, and rising operators—and your network expands ours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An elite storyteller.&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;You write at the level of the best investment memos you have read. Your writing sample will matter more than your resume. You can distill a complex business into a narrative that investors remember, partners repeat, and executives can confidently take into the room.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organized to the point of obsession.&lt;/strong&gt; Nothing you own gets dropped. Ever. You keep the CEO organized as a byproduct of keeping yourself organized.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A magnetic connector.&lt;/strong&gt; Dinners, conferences, board meetings, customer visits, demo days, and travel energize you. You are comfortable with the most senior people in the room and the EQ to put anyone at ease. With warm grounded confidence, you turn conversations into relationships. People seek you out, remember you, and take your call.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Fluent by design.&lt;/strong&gt; You are fluent enough in the AI market to hold your own with lab leadership. RL environments, evals, benchmarks, what the labs are actually buying and why. You will be tested on this.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discreet by default.&lt;/strong&gt; You will know things almost no one else knows. That information never moves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree from a top-tier university with a strong record of academic excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years at a top-tier Silicon Valley venture firm—Associate or Senior Associate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written communication skills with experience producing investment memos, board materials, executive communications, or strategic presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage multiple high-priority workstreams with exceptional attention to detail and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence with the ability to build trust across senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and willingness to travel frequently for domestic and international to AI hubs and conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background that combines venture capital with prior experience in management consulting or investment banking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–5 years at a top-tier Silicon Valley venture firm—Associate or Senior Associate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships within the Silicon Valley venture, growth equity, or frontier AI ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting fundraising, capital formation, M&amp;amp;A, or strategic partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with CEOs or executive leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with enterprise software, AI infrastructure, or frontier AI markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience preparing executives for board meetings, investor meetings, or strategic negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before You Apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role operates at the pace of the CEO. Capital markets, frontier AI labs, and strategic partners do not work standard business hours. Investor conversations may happen over a weekend. Critical negotiations may require immediate follow-up across multiple time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extraordinary outcomes require extraordinary commitment, and we are transparent about those expectations. This is not a traditional Monday-through-Friday role, nor is it intended to become one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you are optimizing for standard working hours or work-life balance at this stage of your career, this is not the right role—and we&#39;d rather you know that now.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For the right person, this is a rare opportunity to help shape one of the defining AI companies of this generation while gaining the judgment and operating experience that often precede executive leadership, venture partnership, or company founding.&lt;strong&gt; Along the way, you will build lasting relationships with leading researchers, executives, founders, and investors across the frontier AI ecosystem.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location &amp;amp; Work Model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time, in-office role with time in both our Palo Alto and San Francisco offices and the flexibility to support the CEO wherever business requires (transportation will be provided transportation between offices).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 75% domestic and international travel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to support global stakeholders across multiple time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual base salary range for this full-time position is &lt;strong&gt;$200,000-$250,000 USD&lt;/strong&gt;. In addition to base salary, this role is eligible for variable compensation, equity and additional benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Individual compensation will be determined based on job-related skills, experience, qualifications, and other relevant business considerations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please submit:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resume&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One writing sample you&#39;re proud of, such as an investment memo, board memo, strategic analysis, presentation, or similar work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our interview process typically includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introductory conversation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive interviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working session&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reference checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Turing is an equal opportunity employer committed to building an inclusive workplace. We celebrate diverse backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences and provide reasonable accommodations throughout the recruiting process for qualified individuals with disabilities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;qzdk59&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3&quot; data-end=&quot;13&quot;&gt;Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;15&quot; data-end=&quot;419&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9oqdlb&quot; data-start=&quot;15&quot; data-end=&quot;155&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;17&quot; data-end=&quot;41&quot;&gt;We are client first:&lt;/strong&gt; We put our clients at the center of everything we do, because their success is the ultimate measure of our value.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
