&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We are hiring a Community Manager to build and grow Turing’s community across developers (Supply) and customers (Demand). Reporting to the Head of Talent Growth, you will own social media, events, and partnerships — turning community engagement into measurable brand advocacy and top-of-funnel impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
