&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;3–5 years in community management, growth marketing, or brand partnerships; consumer marketplace or Talent growth background preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
