&lt;li&gt;Formulate research questions that can inform Turing’s products, platforms, and technical strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore new approaches to synthetic and agentic data generation, reinforcement learning, post-training, model understanding, benchmarks, and evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
